    "type": "question",
    "label": "11",
    "prompt": "Prove that\n$$\\frac{\\sin120^\\circ}{\\tan300^\\circ}-\\frac{\\cos240^\\circ}{\\cot315^\\circ}=\\tan^2 240^\\circ-\\operatorname{cosec}^2 330^\\circ.$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\mathrm{LHS}=\\mathrm{RHS}=-1$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\n\\mathrm{LHS}&=\\frac{\\sin60^\\circ}{-\\tan60^\\circ}-\\frac{-\\cos60^\\circ}{\\frac{1}{-\\tan45^\\circ}}\\\\\n&=\\frac{\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}}{-\\sqrt3}-\\frac{-\\frac12}{\\frac{1}{-1}}\\\\\n&=-\\frac12-\\frac12\\\\\n&=-1.\n\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\mathrm{RHS}&=\\tan^2 60^\\circ-\\frac{1}{(-\\sin30^\\circ)^2}\\\\\n&=3-\\frac{1}{\\frac14}\\\\\n&=-1.\n\\end{align*}$$\nHence $\\mathrm{LHS}=\\mathrm{RHS}$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
